WEBVTT

00:06:59.013 --> 00:07:01.463
who broke their chains 
and changed the world.

00:07:01.463 --> 00:07:02.973
They call me.

00:07:02.973 --> 00:07:04.573
I call them.

00:07:04.573 --> 00:07:07.173
And one day I'll 
write a story right,

00:07:07.173 --> 00:07:14.913
by writing it into a tomorrow on this 
Earth more than worth standing for.

00:07:14.913 --> 00:07:16.973
Thank you.